-- 87 more mass-participation events, across road, gravel and MTB, on six continents.
--
-- Every one was checked on the organiser's own website on 29 September 2026. Where next year's
-- date isn't published, next_date is null and "window" gives the pattern instead — nothing is
-- inferred. Dropped during research (and not included): events that looked defunct or paused,
-- ones whose official site couldn't be reached, and self-supported ultras without a start list.

on conflict (slug) do nothing;   -- safe to re-run; never overwrites an edit made in the admin

select discipline, count(*) from events where status = 'published' group by discipline order by 2 desc;
